        <h1
          class="text-6xl md:text-8xl font-bold tracking-tighter text-slate-900 dark:text-white leading-[0.9]"
        >
          Lukas Bühler
        </h1>

        <p
          class="text-lg md:text-xl text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400 max-w-md leading-relaxed font-light"
        >
          I build <strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-medium"
            >robots</strong
          > and <strong class="text-slate-900 dark:text-white font-medium"
            >web apps</strong
          >. Welcome to my digital garden.
        </p>

